<LanguageData>
    <!-- A lightweight streamlined helmet with a dusky pink fabric lining for comfort.\nThis piece represents a fusion of tactical functionality and aesthetic appeal.\nA bow, glimpsed in the darkness, blooms with a lethal allure. -->
    <Mugirl_ArmorHelmetRecon.description>轻量化流线型头盔，暗粉织物勾勒舒适内衬，兼具战术功能与美学，黑暗中蝴蝶结造型凸显精致设计感。</Mugirl_ArmorHelmetRecon.description>
    <!-- Mugirl Recon Helmet "Énigme de l'Ombre du Papillon" -->
    <Mugirl_ArmorHelmetRecon.label>雪牛娘 侦察头盔 「蝶影谜踪」</Mugirl_ArmorHelmetRecon.label>
    <!-- A signature black short-pile long ear headdress.\nThe lustrous material reflects a playful yet sensual charm.\nThese long ears sway freely with song and dance, capturing a moment of coquettish allure amidst shimmering lights and flowing wine. -->
    <Mugirl_BunnyGirlHeaddress.description>黑色短绒长耳头饰，光滑材质呈现俏皮感，长耳随动作自然摇曳，适合派对或表演活动佩戴。</Mugirl_BunnyGirlHeaddress.description>
    <!-- Mugirl Bunny Girl Headdress "Velours Nocturne Envoûtant" -->
    <Mugirl_BunnyGirlHeaddress.label>雪牛娘 兔女郎头饰 「魅夜绒耳」</Mugirl_BunnyGirlHeaddress.label>
    <!-- A light-gauze mask resting gently over the lips and jaw as if both concealing and revealing. It is not meant to shut the world out, but to hide unspoken expressions and secrets. Among a crowd it preserves a measured distance, leaving true intentions only for those who understand. -->
    <Mugirl_Mask.description>轻纱口罩，轻覆唇颌，似遮非遮。它并非为了隔绝世界，而是为隐藏未被言说的表情与秘密。在人群之中保留分寸感，让真正的意图只留给懂的人。</Mugirl_Mask.description>
    <!-- Mugirl Gauze Mask -->
    <Mugirl_Mask.label>雪牛娘 口罩</Mugirl_Mask.label>
    <!-- Tactical goggles of the information age. Their metal construction provides a small amount of additional protection. -->
    <Mugirl_RA_MechanicRecon.description>信息时代的战术护目镜，金属制造可以提供额外防御力.</Mugirl_RA_MechanicRecon.description>
    <!-- Mugirl Tactical Goggles -->
    <Mugirl_RA_MechanicRecon.label>雪牛娘 战术目镜</Mugirl_RA_MechanicRecon.label>
    <!-- Retro round-frame pinch-on sunglasses, petite yet unable to conceal expressive glances.\nThey maintain a fashionable poise while shielding against glare, an essential urban accessory for the discerning individual. -->
    <Mugirl_Sunglasses.description>复古圆框夹鼻墨镜，小巧精致，遮挡阳光同时保持时尚感，是日常出行和都市活动的实用潮流单品。</Mugirl_Sunglasses.description>
    <!-- Mugirl Sunglasses "Reflet Néon Illusoire" -->
    <Mugirl_Sunglasses.label>雪牛娘 墨镜 「霓虹幻镜」</Mugirl_Sunglasses.label>
    <!-- A retro light-gauze veil, as thin as morning mist and falling with graceful poise. It hints without hiding the charm of the eyes, striking a subtle balance between concealment and allure. In a crowd it carries its own quiet presence, understated yet full of story, a finishing touch for standing out while staying discreet. -->
    <Mugirl_Veil.description>复古轻纱面纱，薄若晨雾，垂落生姿，若隐若现却不掩眉眼风情。在遮挡目光与保留魅力之间取得微妙平衡，行走于人群中自成气场。不张扬，却自带故事感，是大隐于市、低调出挑的风格点睛之物。</Mugirl_Veil.description>
    <!-- Mugirl Veil -->
    <Mugirl_Veil.label>雪牛娘 面纱</Mugirl_Veil.label>
</LanguageData>
